{"title":"Parentheses","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Parentheses</b> are mathematical <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Symbol&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Symbol (page does not exist)\">symbols</a> that are treated as <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Grouping_symbols&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Grouping symbols (page does not exist)\">grouping symbols</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>. Parentheses are indicated by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/3/9a3c1b50bdfddf9bf9a72c55b7672ae691c18356.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$()$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"12\" height=\"18\" />, but square brackets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/1/42133a643fba56fdf0729fb64b397d4dbc95238c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"8\" height=\"18\" /> may be used in place of parentheses.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parentheses&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">Order of operations</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Parentheses&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018102643\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 22/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 byt